  itemprop=\"headline\"  >COST PROJECTIONS PRIOR TO CONSTRUCTION<\/h2><div class='special-heading-border'><div class='special-heading-inner-border'><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/p>\n\n<style type=\"text\/css\" id=\"style-css-av-25bkox-13de773957c41f5c509218825df026e0\">\n#top .flex_column.av-25bkox-13de773957c41f5c509218825df026e0{\nmargin-top:0px;\nmargin-bottom:0px;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div class='flex_column av-25bkox-13de773957c41f5c509218825df026e0 av_one_full  avia-builder-el-22  el_after_av_one_full  el_before_av_one_full  first flex_column_div column-top-margin'   ><section class=\"av_textblock_section \"  itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/CreativeWork\" ><div class='avia_textblock  '   itemprop=\"text\" ><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Construction bids from GCs and subcontractors will start rolling in once you finalize your project drawings. How can you know whether the costs they list are fair? Still, what&#8217;s the best strategy for haggling down the price?\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Our commercial pre-construction estimates are helpful for establishing budgetary priorities and comparing costs. Additionally, commercial estimating services will alert you to any portions of your project that may require reworking before it&#8217;s too late.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/div><\/section><\/div>\n<div class='flex_column av-1xxxf5-bfc932ea8230a390b0bfd5e5dd5a4b77 av_one_full  avia-builder-el-24  el_after_av_one_full  el_before_av_one_full  first flex_column_div column-top-margin'   ><style type=\"text\/css\" id=\"style-css-av-kyo21xmx-5f6e49353df1f7b5ce95dfcedf72c2d6\">\n#top .av-special-heading.av-kyo21xmx-5f6e49353df1f7b5ce95dfcedf72c2d6{\npadding-bottom:10px;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='av-special-heading av-kyo21xmx-5f6e49353df1f7b5ce95dfcedf72c2d6 av-special-heading-h2 blockquote modern-quote  avia-builder-el-25  avia-builder-el-no-sibling  '><h2 class='av-special-heading-tag '  itemprop=\"headline\"  >What Do We Offer?<\/h2><div class='special-heading-border'><div class='special-heading-inner-border'><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n\n<style type=\"text\/css\" id=\"style-css-av-1oiw69-936a75f2510ba4b0e197988a0603b244\">\n#top .flex_column.av-1oiw69-936a75f2510ba4b0e197988a0603b244{\nmargin-top:0px;\nmargin-bottom:0px;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div class='flex_column av-1oiw69-936a75f2510ba4b0e197988a0603b244 av_one_full  avia-builder-el-26  el_after_av_one_full  el_before_av_one_full  first flex_column_div column-top-margin'   ><section class=\"av_textblock_section \"  itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/CreativeWork\" ><div class='avia_textblock  '   itemprop=\"text\" ><p>When working on large projects or trying to get financing from lenders or investors, accurate estimations are especially crucial.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/section><\/div>\n\n<style type=\"text\/css\" id=\"style-css-av-1l9iv5-4fd31e41b2a02f9471aff9a0b2deea27\">\n#top .flex_column.av-1l9iv5-4fd31e41b2a02f9471aff9a0b2deea27{\nmargin-top:20px;\nmargin-bottom:0px;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div class='flex_column av-1l9iv5-4fd31e41b2a02f9471aff9a0b2deea27 av_one_full  avia-builder-el-28  el_after_av_one_full  el_before_av_one_full  first flex_column_div column-top-margin'   ><section class=\"av_textblock_section \"  itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/CreativeWork\" ><div class='avia_textblock  '   itemprop=\"text\" ><h3><b>Initial Price Quotes for the Private Sector<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Commercial developers of our commercial estimation services are in a unique position since they get to weigh in on crucial design choices long before anybody else. This is where our services come in.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">As a result of our experience in evaluating several projects for our customers, we are able to provide preliminary pricing at an early stage in the planning phase and can draw on our extensive database to do so.<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><b>Preliminary Cost Plans and Budgets<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Soon after you have completed your construction designs, you will begin to receive bids from general contractors (GCs) and subcontractors. How can you know whether the costs they list are fair? Yet, how exactly can you negotiate for a lower price?<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Our commercial estimating services are helpful for comparing costs and deciding where investments should be made. Additionally, it will alert you to any portions of your project that may require reworking before it is too late to do so.<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><\/h3>\n<\/div><\/section><\/div><div class='flex_column av-54rld-f8cf93115c89320da65e3ed267ff387a av_one_full  avia-builder-el-30  el_after_av_one_full  el_before_av_one_full  first flex_column_div column-top-margin'   ><style type=\"text\/css\" id=\"style-css-av-kyo2884e-a7e221bfc47059cf50b9af4dbfaa5e60\">\n#top .av-special-heading.av-kyo2884e-a7e221bfc47059cf50b9af4dbfaa5e60{\npadding-bottom:10px;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='av-special-heading av-kyo2884e-a7e221bfc47059cf50b9af4dbfaa5e60 av-special-heading-h2 blockquote modern-quote  avia-builder-el-31  avia-builder-el-no-sibling  '><h2 class='av-special-heading-tag '  itemprop=\"headline\"  >Exactly how Will Our Commercial Estimators Work on Your Project?<\/h2><div class='special-heading-border'><div class='special-heading-inner-border'><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/p>\n<div class='flex_column av-euu7t-0a6460012b9d38f4f2eed664e4da7865 av_one_full  avia-builder-el-32  el_after_av_one_full  el_before_av_one_full  first flex_column_div column-top-margin'   ><div id='avia-messagebox-' class='avia_message_box av_notification av-lb3otq7p-ae36e49ec5e6746eacf6d779b5e3bd15 avia-color-red avia-size-large avia-icon_select-yes avia-border-  avia-builder-el-33  avia-builder-el-no-sibling  ' ><span class='avia_message_box_title' >Note<\/span><div class=\"avia_message_box_content\"><span class='avia_message_bo